      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Here's a draft of the release notes:\n\nOrbit Software v2.4 Release Notes\n\nWe're excited to bring you the latest updates in Orbital, designed to enhance and improve your overall experience. In this release, we've made significant improvements to the dashboard UI, optimized our backend API for faster response times, and added new security patches to keep your data safe.\n\nUnfortunately, we've also identified a few areas that require attention. A database connection timeout issue was resolved, but we're investigating why this occurs every 2 hours. Additionally, we've fixed a user profile picture upload issue on mobile devices and resolved a memory leak in the rendering engine, which can cause your session to slow down over time.\n\nWe've also focused on a few more subtle improvements, including a new dark mode support option and further refinements to our UI layout for a more streamlined experience.",
      "source": "target",
